  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Vector4 based color. Has a higher precision than the regular color
    node and can create values outside of the normal range.


    You can test this by setting a regular Color and Color_float node to RGB(0.5,0.5,0).


    Technically it is possible to also use a Color node as an input. However that
    would defeat the purpose.'
